WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
(melting snow) Winter comes to an end on the mountain.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The shepherdess and her dog lead the herd.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Ancient spirits awaken with the season.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.000
The cycle of life must begin again.
